  "description": "Helen McCormack Estate Agents are pleased to present No 3 Lock Mills, a spacious and well-presented Ground floor 2 Bed / 2 Bath apartment situated within the highly regarded Lock Mills development at Grove Island, Corbally, Limerick.\n\nOccupying a convenient ground floor position, the apartment has recently been refreshed with freshly painted interiors, upgraded smart electric heating and improved lighting, creating a bright and welcoming home ready for immediate occupation.\n\nLock Mills is a mature residential development comprising just 70 apartments across 3 blocks, with a strong owner-occupier community. The complex is professionally managed and offers residents a secure and well-maintained environment.  It also has very spacious open communal parking.  A particular feature of the development also is direct access at the rear to the scenic canal walkway and cycleway, providing an attractive pedestrian and cycling route directly onto the Dublin Road and to the University of Limerick and surrounding areas.\n\nAccommodation\n\nEntrance Hallway\nwith hot press and storage.\n\nKitchen / Dining / Living Area\nA bright and spacious open-plan living area incorporating a fully fitted kitchen with integrated oven and hob together with a washing machine. The living space overlooks the front of the development and offers an excellent layout for everyday living.\n\nMain Bedroom (Ensuite)\nA generous double bedroom with built-in wardrobes. The ensuite comprises WC, WHB and shower.\n\nBedroom 2\nA further double bedroom with fitted wardrobes.\n\nMain Bathroom\nComprising WC, WHB and bath with mixer taps.\n\nThe apartment benefits from upgraded smart electric heating throughout.\n\nDevelopment & Management\n\nResidents benefit from:\n\n- Secure gated vehicular access via GSM phone entry system.\n- Fob-controlled access to apartment buildings.\n- Ample communal parking.\n- Professionally managed common areas.\n\nWe are advised that the annual management fee for the financial year January to December 2026 is €1,900.\n\nLocation\n\nLock Mills enjoys a convenient location adjacent to Grove Island Shopping Centre and Leisure Centre, with SuperValu and a range of everyday amenities on its doorstep. Westbury Shopping Centre is approximately 2km away and offers an excellent selection of shops, cafés, restaurants, pharmacies, hair salons and other local services.\n\nSeveral well-regarded schools and childcare facilities are within walking distance, including St. Munchin's College, Scoil Íde Primary School, Ardscoil Mhuire and Pebbled Pathways Creche.\n\nLimerick City Centre is approximately a 10-minute walk away, while the Dublin Road, Castletroy and the University of Limerick (approximately 4km) are all easily accessible.",
